{
  "uid": "ruview-trends",
  "title": "RuView — Trends",
  "description": "Day by day from the hourly aggregates, which are kept for good: presence, room state, night and day heart and breathing rates, vitals availability, sleep per the server, people, watchdog problems and node health.",
